# Week 5 Data Directory

Place the Telco Customer Churn dataset here.

## Dataset Download

Download from: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/blastchar/telco-customer-churn

Or use the direct link via pandas:
```python
import pandas as pd
url = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IBM/telco-customer-churn-on-icp4d/master/data/Telco-Customer-Churn.csv"
df = pd.read_csv(url)
```

## Expected Files
- `Telco-Customer-Churn.csv` - Main dataset with 7043 rows and 21 columns
